/work/
/docs/evaluations/2026-10-09T115503Z/evidence/baseline/render-results.json
/docs/evaluations/2026-10-09T115503Z/evidence/final/captures/LOT-02-compiled/partial-results.json
/docs/evaluations/2026-10-09T115503Z/evidence/final/captures/LOT-02-imported/partial-results.json
/docs/evaluations/2026-10-09T115503Z/evidence/final/render-results-recaptured.json
/docs/evaluations/2026-10-09T115503Z/evidence/final/render-results.json
/docs/evaluations/2026-10-09T115503Z/source-snapshot/initial-head.tar.gz
